TEXT 0 1664 Left 2 ;A3_base_fvf_mirror_reconstruction, testbench A_ac
TEXT 0 1704 Left 2 ;Nets are joined by their labels (same name = same net). Open in LTspice and press Run.
TEXT 0 1744 Left 2 ;AC at Iin = 10 uA: input impedance = V(inn) for the 1 A AC source; current gain = I(Vo).
TEXT 0 1784 Left 2 !.include ptm90.lib
TEXT 0 1824 Left 2 !.ac dec 40 1k 10G
TEXT 0 1864 Left 2 !.meas AC rin_1k FIND mag(V(inn)) AT=1k
TEXT 0 1904 Left 2 !.meas AC bw_3dB WHEN mag(I(Vo))=0.7071 FALL=1
